{"slug": "cap-theorem", "voice": "af_heart", "sampleRate": 24000, "duration": 288.475, "contentHash": "dc8c89db82ece9b5808365ade40a5d969d90d7ae201f24242897536089dd931f", "blocks": [{"index": 0, "kind": "title", "text": "The CAP Theorem", "start": 0.0, "end": 1.875, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 0.3, "end": 0.438}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 0.438, "end": 0.95}, {"text": "Theorem", "start": 0.95, "end": 1.625}]}, {"index": 1, "kind": "summary", "text": "Why a distributed data store can only pick two of consistency, availability, and partition tolerance — and what that trade-off means in practice.", "start": 1.875, "end": 11.5, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 2.15, "end": 2.337}, {"text": "a", "start": 2.337, "end": 2.4}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 2.4, "end": 3.075}, {"text": "data", "start": 3.075, "end": 3.375}, {"text": "store", "start": 3.375, "end": 3.775}, {"text": "can", "start": 3.775, "end": 3.962}, {"text": "only", "start": 3.962, "end": 4.275}, {"text": "pick", "start": 4.275, "end": 4.537}, {"text": "two", "start": 4.537, "end": 4.85}, {"text": "of", "start": 4.85, "end": 5.0}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 5.0, "end": 6.05}, {"text": "availability", "start": 6.05, "end": 7.125}, {"text": "and", "start": 7.125, "end": 7.325}, {"text": "partition", "start": 7.325, "end": 7.85}, {"text": "tolerance", "start": 7.85, "end": 8.812}, {"text": "and", "start": 8.812, "end": 9.05}, {"text": "what", "start": 9.05, "end": 9.25}, {"text": "that", "start": 9.25, "end": 9.45}, {"text": "trade", "start": 9.45, "end": 9.963}, {"text": "off", "start": 9.963, "end": 9.963}, {"text": "means", "start": 9.963, "end": 10.275}, {"text": "in", "start": 10.275, "end": 10.4}, {"text": "practice", "start": 10.4, "end": 11.25}]}, {"index": 2, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why this matters", "start": 11.5, "end": 13.2, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 11.85, "end": 12.012}, {"text": "this", "start": 12.012, "end": 12.2}, {"text": "matters", "start": 12.2, "end": 12.925}]}, {"index": 3, "kind": "prose", "text": "Sooner or later you'll read an outage postmortem or a database marketing page that says something like \"we chose availability over consistency during the incident.\" The CAP theorem is what gives that sentence meaning. It's the single most quoted idea in distributed systems — you'll hear it in interviews, design reviews, and conference talks. Half the people who mention it get it slightly wrong. (Not you. Not after this lesson.)", "start": 13.2, "end": 38.4, "words": [{"text": "Sooner", "start": 13.525, "end": 13.938}, {"text": "or", "start": 13.938, "end": 14.1}, {"text": "later", "start": 14.1, "end": 14.475}, {"text": "you'll", "start": 14.475, "end": 14.65}, {"text": "read", "start": 14.65, "end": 14.837}, {"text": "an", "start": 14.837, "end": 14.962}, {"text": "outage", "start": 14.962, "end": 15.375}, {"text": "postmortem", "start": 15.375, "end": 16.212}, {"text": "or", "start": 16.212, "end": 16.375}, {"text": "a", "start": 16.375, "end": 16.475}, {"text": "database", "start": 16.475, "end": 17.05}, {"text": "marketing", "start": 17.05, "end": 17.475}, {"text": "page", "start": 17.475, "end": 17.825}, {"text": "that", "start": 17.825, "end": 17.975}, {"text": "says", "start": 17.975, "end": 18.175}, {"text": "something", "start": 18.175, "end": 18.45}, {"text": "like", "start": 18.45, "end": 18.913}, {"text": "we", "start": 18.913, "end": 19.087}, {"text": "chose", "start": 19.087, "end": 19.4}, {"text": "availability", "start": 19.4, "end": 20.15}, {"text": "over", "start": 20.15, "end": 20.375}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 20.375, "end": 21.163}, {"text": "during", "start": 21.163, "end": 21.413}, {"text": "the", "start": 21.413, "end": 21.5}, {"text": "incident", "start": 21.5, "end": 22.45}, {"text": "The", "start": 22.45, "end": 22.75}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 22.75, "end": 23.362}, {"text": "theorem", "start": 23.362, "end": 23.837}, {"text": "is", "start": 23.837, "end": 23.975}, {"text": "what", "start": 23.975, "end": 24.125}, {"text": "gives", "start": 24.125, "end": 24.375}, {"text": "that", "start": 24.375, "end": 24.637}, {"text": "sentence", "start": 24.637, "end": 25.075}, {"text": "meaning", "start": 25.075, "end": 25.8}, {"text": "It's", "start": 25.8, "end": 26.038}, {"text": "the", "start": 26.038, "end": 26.137}, {"text": "single", "start": 26.137, "end": 26.475}, {"text": "most", "start": 26.475, "end": 26.75}, {"text": "quoted", "start": 26.75, "end": 27.112}, {"text": "idea", "start": 27.112, "end": 27.525}, {"text": "in", "start": 27.525, "end": 27.625}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 27.625, "end": 28.225}, {"text": "systems", "start": 28.225, "end": 29.025}, {"text": "you'll", "start": 29.025, "end": 29.3}, {"text": "hear", "start": 29.3, "end": 29.5}, {"text": "it", "start": 29.5, "end": 29.625}, {"text": "in", "start": 29.625, "end": 29.775}, {"text": "interviews", "start": 29.775, "end": 30.45}, {"text": "design", "start": 30.45, "end": 30.925}, {"text": "reviews", "start": 30.925, "end": 31.475}, {"text": "and", "start": 31.475, "end": 31.65}, {"text": "conference", "start": 31.65, "end": 32.15}, {"text": "talks", "start": 32.15, "end": 32.975}, {"text": "Half", "start": 32.975, "end": 33.312}, {"text": "the", "start": 33.312, "end": 33.4}, {"text": "people", "start": 33.4, "end": 33.712}, {"text": "who", "start": 33.712, "end": 33.85}, {"text": "mention", "start": 33.85, "end": 34.175}, {"text": "it", "start": 34.175, "end": 34.3}, {"text": "get", "start": 34.3, "end": 34.438}, {"text": "it", "start": 34.438, "end": 34.587}, {"text": "slightly", "start": 34.587, "end": 34.975}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 34.975, "end": 35.7}, {"text": "Not", "start": 35.7, "end": 36.138}, {"text": "you", "start": 36.138, "end": 36.575}, {"text": "Not", "start": 36.575, "end": 37.0}, {"text": "after", "start": 37.0, "end": 37.263}, {"text": "this", "start": 37.263, "end": 37.45}, {"text": "lesson", "start": 37.45, "end": 38.15}]}, {"index": 4, "kind": "prose", "text": "Picture a restaurant chain", "start": 38.4, "end": 40.4, "words": [{"text": "Picture", "start": 38.65, "end": 39.025}, {"text": "a", "start": 39.025, "end": 39.1}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 39.1, "end": 39.5}, {"text": "chain", "start": 39.5, "end": 40.125}]}, {"index": 5, "kind": "prose", "text": "This lesson's running analogy: you run a tiny restaurant chain with two diners across town, sharing one menu. Let's define the CAP properties in diner terms:", "start": 40.4, "end": 51.3, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 40.675, "end": 40.85}, {"text": "lesson's", "start": 40.85, "end": 41.312}, {"text": "running", "start": 41.312, "end": 41.625}, {"text": "analogy", "start": 41.625, "end": 42.5}, {"text": "you", "start": 42.5, "end": 42.8}, {"text": "run", "start": 42.8, "end": 43.0}, {"text": "a", "start": 43.0, "end": 43.112}, {"text": "tiny", "start": 43.112, "end": 43.575}, {"text": "restaurant", "start": 43.575, "end": 43.987}, {"text": "chain", "start": 43.987, "end": 44.4}, {"text": "with", "start": 44.4, "end": 44.587}, {"text": "two", "start": 44.587, "end": 44.8}, {"text": "diners", "start": 44.8, "end": 45.25}, {"text": "across", "start": 45.25, "end": 45.6}, {"text": "town", "start": 45.6, "end": 46.15}, {"text": "sharing", "start": 46.15, "end": 46.675}, {"text": "one", "start": 46.675, "end": 46.875}, {"text": "menu", "start": 46.875, "end": 47.65}, {"text": "Let's", "start": 47.65, "end": 48.175}, {"text": "define", "start": 48.175, "end": 48.612}, {"text": "the", "start": 48.612, "end": 48.737}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 48.737, "end": 49.275}, {"text": "properties", "start": 49.275, "end": 49.875}, {"text": "in", "start": 49.875, "end": 50.025}, {"text": "diner", "start": 50.025, "end": 50.375}, {"text": "terms", "start": 50.375, "end": 51.05}]}, {"index": 6, "kind": "prose", "text": "Consistency (C) — Both diners' menu boards always show the same specials. If the lunch special changes, every customer at every diner sees the update at the same time. Nobody orders a dish that was cancelled ten minutes ago.", "start": 51.3, "end": 66.325, "words": [{"text": "Consistency", "start": 51.55, "end": 52.487}, {"text": "C", "start": 52.487, "end": 53.0}, {"text": "Both", "start": 53.0, "end": 53.575}, {"text": "diners", "start": 53.575, "end": 54.0}, {"text": "menu", "start": 54.0, "end": 54.325}, {"text": "boards", "start": 54.325, "end": 54.762}, {"text": "always", "start": 54.762, "end": 55.188}, {"text": "show", "start": 55.188, "end": 55.425}, {"text": "the", "start": 55.425, "end": 55.562}, {"text": "same", "start": 55.562, "end": 55.9}, {"text": "specials", "start": 55.9, "end": 56.875}, {"text": "If", "start": 56.875, "end": 57.175}, {"text": "the", "start": 57.175, "end": 57.312}, {"text": "lunch", "start": 57.312, "end": 57.625}, {"text": "special", "start": 57.625, "end": 58.0}, {"text": "changes", "start": 58.0, "end": 58.775}, {"text": "every", "start": 58.775, "end": 59.212}, {"text": "customer", "start": 59.212, "end": 59.75}, {"text": "at", "start": 59.75, "end": 59.887}, {"text": "every", "start": 59.887, "end": 60.2}, {"text": "diner", "start": 60.2, "end": 60.6}, {"text": "sees", "start": 60.6, "end": 60.912}, {"text": "the", "start": 60.912, "end": 61.025}, {"text": "update", "start": 61.025, "end": 61.475}, {"text": "at", "start": 61.475, "end": 61.562}, {"text": "the", "start": 61.562, "end": 61.662}, {"text": "same", "start": 61.662, "end": 62.0}, {"text": "time", "start": 62.0, "end": 62.8}, {"text": "Nobody", "start": 62.8, "end": 63.375}, {"text": "orders", "start": 63.375, "end": 63.725}, {"text": "a", "start": 63.725, "end": 63.837}, {"text": "dish", "start": 63.837, "end": 64.2}, {"text": "that", "start": 64.2, "end": 64.312}, {"text": "was", "start": 64.312, "end": 64.475}, {"text": "cancelled", "start": 64.475, "end": 64.987}, {"text": "ten", "start": 64.987, "end": 65.212}, {"text": "minutes", "start": 65.212, "end": 65.487}, {"text": "ago", "start": 65.487, "end": 66.075}]}, {"index": 7, "kind": "prose", "text": "Availability (A) — Every diner always seats every customer and takes every order, no exceptions. Nobody is turned away or told to \"come back later.\"", "start": 66.325, "end": 76.525, "words": [{"text": "Availability", "start": 66.6, "end": 67.513}, {"text": "A", "start": 67.513, "end": 68.025}, {"text": "Every", "start": 68.025, "end": 68.6}, {"text": "diner", "start": 68.6, "end": 68.963}, {"text": "always", "start": 68.963, "end": 69.325}, {"text": "seats", "start": 69.325, "end": 69.612}, {"text": "every", "start": 69.612, "end": 69.925}, {"text": "customer", "start": 69.925, "end": 70.5}, {"text": "and", "start": 70.5, "end": 70.625}, {"text": "takes", "start": 70.625, "end": 70.938}, {"text": "every", "start": 70.938, "end": 71.25}, {"text": "order", "start": 71.25, "end": 71.775}, {"text": "no", "start": 71.775, "end": 72.15}, {"text": "exceptions", "start": 72.15, "end": 73.2}, {"text": "Nobody", "start": 73.2, "end": 73.725}, {"text": "is", "start": 73.725, "end": 73.875}, {"text": "turned", "start": 73.875, "end": 74.112}, {"text": "away", "start": 74.112, "end": 74.513}, {"text": "or", "start": 74.513, "end": 74.688}, {"text": "told", "start": 74.688, "end": 75.05}, {"text": "to", "start": 75.05, "end": 75.163}, {"text": "come", "start": 75.163, "end": 75.375}, {"text": "back", "start": 75.375, "end": 75.65}, {"text": "later", "start": 75.65, "end": 76.25}]}, {"index": 8, "kind": "prose", "text": "Partition tolerance (P) — The system keeps working even if the phone line between the two diners is cut and they can't talk to each other.", "start": 76.525, "end": 85.175, "words": [{"text": "Partition", "start": 76.775, "end": 77.363}, {"text": "tolerance", "start": 77.363, "end": 78.025}, {"text": "P", "start": 78.025, "end": 78.625}, {"text": "The", "start": 78.625, "end": 79.113}, {"text": "system", "start": 79.113, "end": 79.5}, {"text": "keeps", "start": 79.5, "end": 79.8}, {"text": "working", "start": 79.8, "end": 80.188}, {"text": "even", "start": 80.188, "end": 80.488}, {"text": "if", "start": 80.488, "end": 80.613}, {"text": "the", "start": 80.613, "end": 80.75}, {"text": "phone", "start": 80.75, "end": 81.1}, {"text": "line", "start": 81.1, "end": 81.425}, {"text": "between", "start": 81.425, "end": 81.738}, {"text": "the", "start": 81.738, "end": 81.825}, {"text": "two", "start": 81.825, "end": 82.025}, {"text": "diners", "start": 82.025, "end": 82.475}, {"text": "is", "start": 82.475, "end": 82.638}, {"text": "cut", "start": 82.638, "end": 83.225}, {"text": "and", "start": 83.225, "end": 83.363}, {"text": "they", "start": 83.363, "end": 83.513}, {"text": "can't", "start": 83.513, "end": 83.8}, {"text": "talk", "start": 83.8, "end": 84.075}, {"text": "to", "start": 84.075, "end": 84.163}, {"text": "each", "start": 84.163, "end": 84.338}, {"text": "other", "start": 84.338, "end": 84.925}]}, {"index": 9, "kind": "prose", "text": "And here's the thing about that phone line: it will get cut. Cables get chewed, switches die, packets vanish into the void. In the world of networks, the gremlins always strike eventually — usually at 2 a.m., usually right before your launch. A partition is simply two servers that are both alive, both serving customers, but unable to reach each other:", "start": 85.175, "end": 107.125, "words": [{"text": "And", "start": 85.45, "end": 85.6}, {"text": "here's", "start": 85.6, "end": 85.888}, {"text": "the", "start": 85.888, "end": 85.987}, {"text": "thing", "start": 85.987, "end": 86.188}, {"text": "about", "start": 86.188, "end": 86.425}, {"text": "that", "start": 86.425, "end": 86.688}, {"text": "phone", "start": 86.688, "end": 86.975}, {"text": "line", "start": 86.975, "end": 87.6}, {"text": "it", "start": 87.6, "end": 87.812}, {"text": "will", "start": 87.812, "end": 87.925}, {"text": "get", "start": 87.925, "end": 88.138}, {"text": "cut", "start": 88.138, "end": 88.875}, {"text": "Cables", "start": 88.875, "end": 89.475}, {"text": "get", "start": 89.475, "end": 89.7}, {"text": "chewed", "start": 89.7, "end": 90.2}, {"text": "switches", "start": 90.2, "end": 90.75}, {"text": "die", "start": 90.75, "end": 91.1}, {"text": "packets", "start": 91.1, "end": 91.662}, {"text": "vanish", "start": 91.662, "end": 92.087}, {"text": "into", "start": 92.087, "end": 92.263}, {"text": "the", "start": 92.263, "end": 92.35}, {"text": "void", "start": 92.35, "end": 93.15}, {"text": "In", "start": 93.15, "end": 93.412}, {"text": "the", "start": 93.412, "end": 93.5}, {"text": "world", "start": 93.5, "end": 93.763}, {"text": "of", "start": 93.763, "end": 93.85}, {"text": "networks", "start": 93.85, "end": 94.325}, {"text": "the", "start": 94.325, "end": 94.45}, {"text": "gremlins", "start": 94.45, "end": 94.962}, {"text": "always", "start": 94.962, "end": 95.325}, {"text": "strike", "start": 95.325, "end": 95.65}, {"text": "eventually", "start": 95.65, "end": 96.438}, {"text": "usually", "start": 96.438, "end": 97.062}, {"text": "at", "start": 97.062, "end": 97.237}, {"text": "2", "start": 97.237, "end": 97.513}, {"text": "a", "start": 97.513, "end": 98.287}, {"text": "m", "start": 98.287, "end": 98.287}, {"text": "usually", "start": 98.287, "end": 98.737}, {"text": "right", "start": 98.737, "end": 99.05}, {"text": "before", "start": 99.05, "end": 99.362}, {"text": "your", "start": 99.362, "end": 99.475}, {"text": "launch", "start": 99.475, "end": 100.225}, {"text": "A", "start": 100.225, "end": 100.525}, {"text": "partition", "start": 100.525, "end": 101.125}, {"text": "is", "start": 101.125, "end": 101.25}, {"text": "simply", "start": 101.25, "end": 101.625}, {"text": "two", "start": 101.625, "end": 101.887}, {"text": "servers", "start": 101.887, "end": 102.35}, {"text": "that", "start": 102.35, "end": 102.463}, {"text": "are", "start": 102.463, "end": 102.55}, {"text": "both", "start": 102.55, "end": 102.825}, {"text": "alive", "start": 102.825, "end": 103.4}, {"text": "both", "start": 103.4, "end": 103.787}, {"text": "serving", "start": 103.787, "end": 104.175}, {"text": "customers", "start": 104.175, "end": 104.975}, {"text": "but", "start": 104.975, "end": 105.2}, {"text": "unable", "start": 105.2, "end": 105.7}, {"text": "to", "start": 105.7, "end": 105.825}, {"text": "reach", "start": 105.825, "end": 106.062}, {"text": "each", "start": 106.062, "end": 106.262}, {"text": "other", "start": 106.262, "end": 106.875}]}, {"index": 10, "kind": "prose", "text": "The theorem, precisely", "start": 107.125, "end": 109.175, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 107.4, "end": 107.537}, {"text": "theorem", "start": 107.537, "end": 108.0}, {"text": "precisely", "start": 108.0, "end": 108.95}]}, {"index": 11, "kind": "prose", "text": "In the presence of a network partition, a distributed system must choose between consistency and availability. It cannot provide both.", "start": 109.175, "end": 118.0, "words": [{"text": "In", "start": 109.45, "end": 109.537}, {"text": "the", "start": 109.537, "end": 109.625}, {"text": "presence", "start": 109.625, "end": 110.1}, {"text": "of", "start": 110.1, "end": 110.188}, {"text": "a", "start": 110.188, "end": 110.275}, {"text": "network", "start": 110.275, "end": 110.675}, {"text": "partition", "start": 110.675, "end": 111.5}, {"text": "a", "start": 111.5, "end": 111.675}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 111.675, "end": 112.35}, {"text": "system", "start": 112.35, "end": 112.825}, {"text": "must", "start": 112.825, "end": 113.087}, {"text": "choose", "start": 113.087, "end": 113.45}, {"text": "between", "start": 113.45, "end": 113.8}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 113.8, "end": 114.8}, {"text": "and", "start": 114.8, "end": 114.938}, {"text": "availability", "start": 114.938, "end": 116.125}, {"text": "It", "start": 116.125, "end": 116.425}, {"text": "cannot", "start": 116.425, "end": 116.775}, {"text": "provide", "start": 116.775, "end": 117.175}, {"text": "both", "start": 117.175, "end": 117.75}]}, {"index": 12, "kind": "prose", "text": "Why? Go back to the diners. The phone line is cut. A customer at Diner 1 orders the new lunch special. Diner 2 has no idea the special changed — its menu board is stale. Now a customer at Diner 2 asks \"what's the special?\"", "start": 118.0, "end": 133.825, "words": [{"text": "Why", "start": 118.3, "end": 118.625}, {"text": "Go", "start": 118.625, "end": 118.875}, {"text": "back", "start": 118.875, "end": 119.15}, {"text": "to", "start": 119.15, "end": 119.237}, {"text": "the", "start": 119.237, "end": 119.325}, {"text": "diners", "start": 119.325, "end": 120.05}, {"text": "The", "start": 120.05, "end": 120.275}, {"text": "phone", "start": 120.275, "end": 120.625}, {"text": "line", "start": 120.625, "end": 120.888}, {"text": "is", "start": 120.888, "end": 121.037}, {"text": "cut", "start": 121.037, "end": 121.7}, {"text": "A", "start": 121.7, "end": 121.925}, {"text": "customer", "start": 121.925, "end": 122.45}, {"text": "at", "start": 122.45, "end": 122.575}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 122.575, "end": 122.95}, {"text": "1", "start": 122.95, "end": 123.338}, {"text": "orders", "start": 123.338, "end": 123.775}, {"text": "the", "start": 123.775, "end": 123.912}, {"text": "new", "start": 123.912, "end": 124.1}, {"text": "lunch", "start": 124.1, "end": 124.4}, {"text": "special", "start": 124.4, "end": 125.275}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 125.275, "end": 125.838}, {"text": "2", "start": 125.838, "end": 126.1}, {"text": "has", "start": 126.1, "end": 126.312}, {"text": "no", "start": 126.312, "end": 126.575}, {"text": "idea", "start": 126.575, "end": 127.0}, {"text": "the", "start": 127.0, "end": 127.1}, {"text": "special", "start": 127.1, "end": 127.487}, {"text": "changed", "start": 127.487, "end": 128.238}, {"text": "its", "start": 128.238, "end": 128.562}, {"text": "menu", "start": 128.562, "end": 128.912}, {"text": "board", "start": 128.912, "end": 129.25}, {"text": "is", "start": 129.25, "end": 129.387}, {"text": "stale", "start": 129.387, "end": 130.15}, {"text": "Now", "start": 130.15, "end": 130.525}, {"text": "a", "start": 130.525, "end": 130.625}, {"text": "customer", "start": 130.625, "end": 131.15}, {"text": "at", "start": 131.15, "end": 131.25}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 131.25, "end": 131.613}, {"text": "2", "start": 131.613, "end": 131.887}, {"text": "asks", "start": 131.887, "end": 132.5}, {"text": "what's", "start": 132.5, "end": 132.75}, {"text": "the", "start": 132.75, "end": 132.85}, {"text": "special", "start": 132.85, "end": 133.575}]}, {"index": 13, "kind": "prose", "text": "You have exactly two options, and they are both a little awkward:", "start": 133.825, "end": 137.875, "words": [{"text": "You", "start": 134.1, "end": 134.2}, {"text": "have", "start": 134.2, "end": 134.362}, {"text": "exactly", "start": 134.362, "end": 134.912}, {"text": "two", "start": 134.912, "end": 135.125}, {"text": "options", "start": 135.125, "end": 135.875}, {"text": "and", "start": 135.875, "end": 136.087}, {"text": "they", "start": 136.087, "end": 136.225}, {"text": "are", "start": 136.225, "end": 136.375}, {"text": "both", "start": 136.375, "end": 136.662}, {"text": "a", "start": 136.662, "end": 136.712}, {"text": "little", "start": 136.712, "end": 136.925}, {"text": "awkward", "start": 136.925, "end": 137.625}]}, {"index": 14, "kind": "prose", "text": "Diner 2 answers with the old special (stale data) — that's availability: everyone gets served, but not everyone gets the truth.", "start": 137.875, "end": 146.275, "words": [{"text": "Diner", "start": 138.175, "end": 138.537}, {"text": "2", "start": 138.537, "end": 138.838}, {"text": "answers", "start": 138.838, "end": 139.338}, {"text": "with", "start": 139.338, "end": 139.438}, {"text": "the", "start": 139.438, "end": 139.55}, {"text": "old", "start": 139.55, "end": 139.825}, {"text": "special", "start": 139.825, "end": 140.363}, {"text": "stale", "start": 140.363, "end": 140.675}, {"text": "data", "start": 140.675, "end": 141.275}, {"text": "that's", "start": 141.275, "end": 141.812}, {"text": "availability", "start": 141.812, "end": 142.825}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 142.825, "end": 143.425}, {"text": "gets", "start": 143.425, "end": 143.662}, {"text": "served", "start": 143.662, "end": 144.125}, {"text": "but", "start": 144.125, "end": 144.35}, {"text": "not", "start": 144.35, "end": 144.6}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 144.6, "end": 145.05}, {"text": "gets", "start": 145.05, "end": 145.3}, {"text": "the", "start": 145.3, "end": 145.412}, {"text": "truth", "start": 145.412, "end": 146.025}]}, {"index": 15, "kind": "prose", "text": "Diner 2 refuses to answer until it can confirm the menu — that's consistency: no one gets a wrong answer, but someone gets no answer at all.", "start": 146.275, "end": 155.975, "words": [{"text": "Diner", "start": 146.575, "end": 146.95}, {"text": "2", "start": 146.95, "end": 147.338}, {"text": "refuses", "start": 147.338, "end": 147.9}, {"text": "to", "start": 147.9, "end": 148.037}, {"text": "answer", "start": 148.037, "end": 148.575}, {"text": "until", "start": 148.575, "end": 148.863}, {"text": "it", "start": 148.863, "end": 148.95}, {"text": "can", "start": 148.95, "end": 149.075}, {"text": "confirm", "start": 149.075, "end": 149.562}, {"text": "the", "start": 149.562, "end": 149.65}, {"text": "menu", "start": 149.65, "end": 150.238}, {"text": "that's", "start": 150.238, "end": 150.6}, {"text": "consistency", "start": 150.6, "end": 151.8}, {"text": "no", "start": 151.8, "end": 152.2}, {"text": "one", "start": 152.2, "end": 152.35}, {"text": "gets", "start": 152.35, "end": 152.562}, {"text": "a", "start": 152.562, "end": 152.65}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 152.65, "end": 152.95}, {"text": "answer", "start": 152.95, "end": 153.625}, {"text": "but", "start": 153.625, "end": 153.912}, {"text": "someone", "start": 153.912, "end": 154.275}, {"text": "gets", "start": 154.275, "end": 154.525}, {"text": "no", "start": 154.525, "end": 154.7}, {"text": "answer", "start": 154.7, "end": 155.05}, {"text": "at", "start": 155.05, "end": 155.15}, {"text": "all", "start": 155.15, "end": 155.725}]}, {"index": 16, "kind": "prose", "text": "There is no third option where the diner serves the correct special without talking to Diner 1. That's the whole theorem. It's less a deep mathematical mystery and more a very obvious dilemma — dressed up in academic clothes.", "start": 155.975, "end": 170.275, "words": [{"text": "There", "start": 156.25, "end": 156.4}, {"text": "is", "start": 156.4, "end": 156.562}, {"text": "no", "start": 156.562, "end": 156.887}, {"text": "third", "start": 156.887, "end": 157.2}, {"text": "option", "start": 157.2, "end": 157.75}, {"text": "where", "start": 157.75, "end": 157.887}, {"text": "the", "start": 157.887, "end": 157.987}, {"text": "diner", "start": 157.987, "end": 158.412}, {"text": "serves", "start": 158.412, "end": 158.775}, {"text": "the", "start": 158.775, "end": 158.875}, {"text": "correct", "start": 158.875, "end": 159.3}, {"text": "special", "start": 159.3, "end": 159.862}, {"text": "without", "start": 159.862, "end": 160.2}, {"text": "talking", "start": 160.2, "end": 160.625}, {"text": "to", "start": 160.625, "end": 160.75}, {"text": "Diner", "start": 160.75, "end": 161.125}, {"text": "1", "start": 161.125, "end": 161.85}, {"text": "That's", "start": 161.85, "end": 162.325}, {"text": "the", "start": 162.325, "end": 162.425}, {"text": "whole", "start": 162.425, "end": 162.713}, {"text": "theorem", "start": 162.713, "end": 163.525}, {"text": "It's", "start": 163.525, "end": 163.875}, {"text": "less", "start": 163.875, "end": 164.1}, {"text": "a", "start": 164.1, "end": 164.225}, {"text": "deep", "start": 164.225, "end": 164.525}, {"text": "mathematical", "start": 164.525, "end": 165.325}, {"text": "mystery", "start": 165.325, "end": 165.975}, {"text": "and", "start": 165.975, "end": 166.125}, {"text": "more", "start": 166.125, "end": 166.325}, {"text": "a", "start": 166.325, "end": 166.4}, {"text": "very", "start": 166.4, "end": 166.737}, {"text": "obvious", "start": 166.737, "end": 167.225}, {"text": "dilemma", "start": 167.225, "end": 167.95}, {"text": "dressed", "start": 167.95, "end": 168.362}, {"text": "up", "start": 168.362, "end": 168.55}, {"text": "in", "start": 168.55, "end": 168.7}, {"text": "academic", "start": 168.7, "end": 169.25}, {"text": "clothes", "start": 169.25, "end": 170.025}]}, {"index": 17, "kind": "prose", "text": "Because partitions are inevitable, the \"P\" in CAP is really non-negotiable for a distributed system — so the practical question is: during a partition, are you CP or AP?", "start": 170.275, "end": 182.45, "words": [{"text": "Because", "start": 170.525, "end": 170.825}, {"text": "partitions", "start": 170.825, "end": 171.5}, {"text": "are", "start": 171.5, "end": 171.625}, {"text": "inevitable", "start": 171.625, "end": 172.45}, {"text": "the", "start": 172.45, "end": 172.675}, {"text": "P", "start": 172.675, "end": 173.025}, {"text": "in", "start": 173.025, "end": 173.238}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 173.238, "end": 173.912}, {"text": "is", "start": 173.912, "end": 174.088}, {"text": "really", "start": 174.088, "end": 174.4}, {"text": "non", "start": 174.4, "end": 175.275}, {"text": "negotiable", "start": 175.275, "end": 175.275}, {"text": "for", "start": 175.275, "end": 175.388}, {"text": "a", "start": 175.388, "end": 175.45}, {"text": "distributed", "start": 175.45, "end": 176.075}, {"text": "system", "start": 176.075, "end": 176.95}, {"text": "so", "start": 176.95, "end": 177.162}, {"text": "the", "start": 177.162, "end": 177.25}, {"text": "practical", "start": 177.25, "end": 177.775}, {"text": "question", "start": 177.775, "end": 178.263}, {"text": "is", "start": 178.263, "end": 178.85}, {"text": "during", "start": 178.85, "end": 179.263}, {"text": "a", "start": 179.263, "end": 179.325}, {"text": "partition", "start": 179.325, "end": 180.1}, {"text": "are", "start": 180.1, "end": 180.35}, {"text": "you", "start": 180.35, "end": 180.525}, {"text": "CP", "start": 180.525, "end": 181.2}, {"text": "or", "start": 181.2, "end": 181.388}, {"text": "AP", "start": 181.388, "end": 182.2}]}, {"index": 18, "kind": "prose", "text": "Choice, During a partition, Example systems", "start": 182.45, "end": 185.675, "words": [{"text": "Choice", "start": 182.75, "end": 183.1}, {"text": "During", "start": 183.1, "end": 183.362}, {"text": "a", "start": 183.362, "end": 183.425}, {"text": "partition", "start": 183.425, "end": 184.075}, {"text": "Example", "start": 184.075, "end": 184.7}, {"text": "systems", "start": 184.7, "end": 185.45}]}, {"index": 19, "kind": "prose", "text": "CP, Reject or block requests it can't guarantee are consistent, ZooKeeper, etcd, HBase", "start": 185.675, "end": 192.6, "words": [{"text": "CP", "start": 185.975, "end": 186.45}, {"text": "Reject", "start": 186.45, "end": 186.95}, {"text": "or", "start": 186.95, "end": 187.075}, {"text": "block", "start": 187.075, "end": 187.425}, {"text": "requests", "start": 187.425, "end": 187.812}, {"text": "it", "start": 187.812, "end": 187.9}, {"text": "can't", "start": 187.9, "end": 188.175}, {"text": "guarantee", "start": 188.175, "end": 188.7}, {"text": "are", "start": 188.7, "end": 188.8}, {"text": "consistent", "start": 188.8, "end": 189.725}, {"text": "ZooKeeper", "start": 189.725, "end": 190.675}, {"text": "etcd", "start": 190.675, "end": 191.425}, {"text": "HBase", "start": 191.425, "end": 192.375}]}, {"index": 20, "kind": "prose", "text": "AP, Keep serving requests, possibly with stale or conflicting data, Cassandra, DynamoDB, Riak", "start": 192.6, "end": 199.55, "words": [{"text": "AP", "start": 192.875, "end": 193.325}, {"text": "Keep", "start": 193.325, "end": 193.625}, {"text": "serving", "start": 193.625, "end": 193.938}, {"text": "requests", "start": 193.938, "end": 194.725}, {"text": "possibly", "start": 194.725, "end": 195.287}, {"text": "with", "start": 195.287, "end": 195.45}, {"text": "stale", "start": 195.45, "end": 195.875}, {"text": "or", "start": 195.875, "end": 196.0}, {"text": "conflicting", "start": 196.0, "end": 196.525}, {"text": "data", "start": 196.525, "end": 196.925}, {"text": "Cassandra", "start": 196.925, "end": 197.675}, {"text": "DynamoDB", "start": 197.675, "end": 198.55}, {"text": "Riak", "start": 198.55, "end": 199.3}]}, {"index": 21, "kind": "prose", "text": "A CP system would rather close the kitchen than serve the wrong special:", "start": 199.55, "end": 204.275, "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 199.825, "end": 199.913}, {"text": "CP", "start": 199.913, "end": 200.325}, {"text": "system", "start": 200.325, "end": 200.825}, {"text": "would", "start": 200.825, "end": 200.95}, {"text": "rather", "start": 200.95, "end": 201.288}, {"text": "close", "start": 201.288, "end": 201.613}, {"text": "the", "start": 201.613, "end": 201.7}, {"text": "kitchen", "start": 201.7, "end": 202.438}, {"text": "than", "start": 202.438, "end": 202.625}, {"text": "serve", "start": 202.625, "end": 202.888}, {"text": "the", "start": 202.888, "end": 202.975}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 202.975, "end": 203.275}, {"text": "special", "start": 203.275, "end": 204.025}]}, {"index": 22, "kind": "prose", "text": "The thing everyone gets wrong", "start": 204.275, "end": 206.375, "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 204.55, "end": 204.65}, {"text": "thing", "start": 204.65, "end": 204.875}, {"text": "everyone", "start": 204.875, "end": 205.325}, {"text": "gets", "start": 205.325, "end": 205.575}, {"text": "wrong", "start": 205.575, "end": 206.125}]}, {"index": 23, "kind": "prose", "text": "Here is the misconception to watch for at parties: CAP does not say a system must permanently pick only two of three, like some kind of loyalty program. When the phone line is working — which is most of the time — a system can be both consistent and available. The trade-off only bites during a partition. It's a fire-escape plan, not a personality type.", "start": 206.375, "end": 228.8, "words": [{"text": "Here", "start": 206.65, "end": 206.875}, {"text": "is", "start": 206.875, "end": 207.025}, {"text": "the", "start": 207.025, "end": 207.125}, {"text": "misconception", "start": 207.125, "end": 207.925}, {"text": "to", "start": 207.925, "end": 208.05}, {"text": "watch", "start": 208.05, "end": 208.35}, {"text": "for", "start": 208.35, "end": 208.5}, {"text": "at", "start": 208.5, "end": 208.6}, {"text": "parties", "start": 208.6, "end": 209.5}, {"text": "CAP", "start": 209.5, "end": 210.225}, {"text": "does", "start": 210.225, "end": 210.4}, {"text": "not", "start": 210.4, "end": 210.65}, {"text": "say", "start": 210.65, "end": 210.925}, {"text": "a", "start": 210.925, "end": 211.037}, {"text": "system", "start": 211.037, "end": 211.475}, {"text": "must", "start": 211.475, "end": 211.7}, {"text": "permanently", "start": 211.7, "end": 212.225}, {"text": "pick", "start": 212.225, "end": 212.475}, {"text": "only", "start": 212.475, "end": 212.812}, {"text": "two", "start": 212.812, "end": 213.025}, {"text": "of", "start": 213.025, "end": 213.162}, {"text": "three", "start": 213.162, "end": 213.65}, {"text": "like", "start": 213.65, "end": 213.975}, {"text": "some", "start": 213.975, "end": 214.2}, {"text": "kind", "start": 214.2, "end": 214.412}, {"text": "of", "start": 214.412, "end": 214.5}, {"text": "loyalty", "start": 214.5, "end": 214.95}, {"text": "program", "start": 214.95, "end": 215.875}, {"text": "When", "start": 215.875, "end": 216.137}, {"text": "the", "start": 216.137, "end": 216.238}, {"text": "phone", "start": 216.238, "end": 216.575}, {"text": "line", "start": 216.575, "end": 216.838}, {"text": "is", "start": 216.838, "end": 216.975}, {"text": "working", "start": 216.975, "end": 217.65}, {"text": "which", "start": 217.65, "end": 217.925}, {"text": "is", "start": 217.925, "end": 218.075}, {"text": "most", "start": 218.075, "end": 218.363}, {"text": "of", "start": 218.363, "end": 218.438}, {"text": "the", "start": 218.438, "end": 218.537}, {"text": "time", "start": 218.537, "end": 219.262}, {"text": "a", "start": 219.262, "end": 219.488}, {"text": "system", "start": 219.488, "end": 219.95}, {"text": "can", "start": 219.95, "end": 220.088}, {"text": "be", "start": 220.088, "end": 220.225}, {"text": "both", "start": 220.225, "end": 220.475}, {"text": "consistent", "start": 220.475, "end": 221.387}, {"text": "and", "start": 221.387, "end": 221.575}, {"text": "available", "start": 221.575, "end": 222.575}, {"text": "The", "start": 222.575, "end": 222.825}, {"text": "trade", "start": 222.825, "end": 223.3}, {"text": "off", "start": 223.3, "end": 223.3}, {"text": "only", "start": 223.3, "end": 223.613}, {"text": "bites", "start": 223.613, "end": 223.975}, {"text": "during", "start": 223.975, "end": 224.213}, {"text": "a", "start": 224.213, "end": 224.275}, {"text": "partition", "start": 224.275, "end": 225.225}, {"text": "It's", "start": 225.225, "end": 225.488}, {"text": "a", "start": 225.488, "end": 225.6}, {"text": "fire", "start": 225.6, "end": 226.35}, {"text": "escape", "start": 226.35, "end": 226.35}, {"text": "plan", "start": 226.35, "end": 226.9}, {"text": "not", "start": 226.9, "end": 227.162}, {"text": "a", "start": 227.162, "end": 227.225}, {"text": "personality", "start": 227.225, "end": 227.95}, {"text": "type", "start": 227.95, "end": 228.55}]}, {"index": 24, "kind": "prose", "text": "This is also why later models like PACELC extended CAP: they ask \"and even when there's no partition, are you trading consistency for latency?\" Because the gremlins are always in the details.", "start": 228.8, "end": 242.45, "words": [{"text": "This", "start": 229.075, "end": 229.25}, {"text": "is", "start": 229.25, "end": 229.4}, {"text": "also", "start": 229.4, "end": 229.8}, {"text": "why", "start": 229.8, "end": 230.038}, {"text": "later", "start": 230.038, "end": 230.425}, {"text": "models", "start": 230.425, "end": 230.875}, {"text": "like", "start": 230.875, "end": 231.113}, {"text": "PACELC", "start": 231.113, "end": 232.375}, {"text": "extended", "start": 232.375, "end